#: src/features/legal/texts/static/render.tsx
msgid "A copy of the texts in the POWR app, made with version {version} ({build}) of the app. The app shows the same texts under Settings, Legal."
msgstr "A copy of the texts in the POWR app, made with version {version} ({build}) of the app. The app shows the same texts under Settings, Legal."

#: src/features/legal/texts/HowPowrDecides.tsx
msgid "A value marked \"Preliminary value\" has not yet been checked against the original publication, comes from a study that is not yet peer-reviewed (a preprint), or is a design choice of POWR where research only gives a direction. It may change after a review; any change comes with a new registry version. {preliminary} of the {total} values are preliminary in this version."
msgstr "A value marked \"Preliminary value\" has not yet been checked against the original publication, comes from a study that is not yet peer-reviewed (a preprint), or is a design choice of POWR where research only gives a direction. It may change after a review; any change comes with a new registry version. {preliminary} of the {total} values are preliminary in this version."

#: src/features/legal/texts/HowPowrDecides.tsx
msgid "A value or model POWR chose where research gives only a direction. Treat it as a starting point."
msgstr "A value or model POWR chose where research gives only a direction. Treat it as a starting point."

#: src/features/legal/texts/HowPowrDecides.tsx
msgid "A week counts for your streak when you did the workouts you planned. Breaks pause it, they never break it."
msgstr "A week counts for your streak when you did the workouts you planned. Breaks pause it, they never break it."

#: src/features/legal/texts/Imprint.tsx
msgid "About this app"
msgstr "About this app"

#: src/features/legal/texts/HowPowrDecides.tsx
msgid "After a block of training weeks comes a lighter week with fewer sets and a little more in reserve. POWR offers it earlier when several signs suggest it. After a break, the first workouts ease back in."
msgstr "After a block of training weeks comes a lighter week with fewer sets and a little more in reserve. POWR offers it earlier when several signs suggest it. After a break, the first workouts ease back in."

#: src/features/legal/texts/Privacy.tsx
msgid "All of it stays in your browser's storage on this device, for this app only. POWR uses it for one purpose: to run the app for you, for example to plan your training, suggest weights and show your progress. Some of it, such as body data, pain notes and check-ins, can be health data. It never leaves your device unless you export it."
msgstr "All of it stays in your browser's storage on this device, for this app only. POWR uses it for one purpose: to run the app for you, for example to plan your training, suggest weights and show your progress. Some of it, such as body data, pain notes and check-ins, can be health data. It never leaves your device unless you export it."

#: src/features/legal/texts/HowPowrDecides.tsx
msgid "Assistance exercises add reps until the top of the range, then a small weight step (double progression). Main lifts use your estimated 1-rep max and the target effort; beginners (called novices in training research) add a fixed step each workout. Steps follow your equipment and your level."
msgstr "Assistance exercises add reps until the top of the range, then a small weight step (double progression). Main lifts use your estimated 1-rep max and the target effort; beginners (called novices in training research) add a fixed step each workout. Steps follow your equipment and your level."

#: src/features/legal/texts/Privacy.tsx
msgid "Backups and exported files"
msgstr "Backups and exported files"

#: src/features/legal/texts/Privacy.tsx
msgid "Backups, calendar files and other exports are created on your device and are under your control. If you store or share them elsewhere, for example in a cloud drive, by e-mail or in a messenger, that service's terms and privacy policy apply. Backup files are not encrypted, so keep them somewhere safe."
msgstr "Backups, calendar files and other exports are created on your device and are under your control. If you store or share them elsewhere, for example in a cloud drive, by e-mail or in a messenger, that service's terms and privacy policy apply. Backup files are not encrypted, so keep them somewhere safe."

#: src/features/legal/texts/Privacy.tsx
msgid "Because your training data is only on your device, you exercise most of these rights yourself in the app: view it, correct it, export it as a backup or delete it. For anything else, for example a question about the hosting, write to us."
msgstr "Because your training data is only on your device, you exercise most of these rights yourself in the app: view it, correct it, export it as a backup or delete it. For anything else, for example a question about the hosting, write to us."

