#: src/features/legal/texts/HowPowrDecides.tsx
msgid "Volume is counted as hard sets per muscle per week: sets close to failure count fully, and an exercise counts fully for its main muscles and in part for helping muscles. Weekly targets sit inside a range from research, with fewer sets for beginners and more for muscles you chose as priorities."
msgstr "Volume is counted as hard sets per muscle per week: sets close to failure count fully, and an exercise counts fully for its main muscles and in part for helping muscles. Weekly targets sit inside a range from research, with fewer sets for beginners and more for muscles you chose as priorities."

