msgstr "warm up before heavy sets;"

#: src/features/legal/texts/HowPowrDecides.tsx
msgid "Warm-up sets"
msgstr "Warm-up sets"

#: src/features/legal/texts/HowPowrDecides.tsx
msgid "Warm-up sets ramp up to your first working weight: more steps before heavy sets, fewer for exercises whose muscles are already warm. You can switch them off in Settings."
msgstr "Warm-up sets ramp up to your first working weight: more steps before heavy sets, fewer for exercises whose muscles are already warm. You can switch them off in Settings."

